    "A room held under a scope cannot be arranged ahead. Send a link with a time on it instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A room held under a scope cannot be arranged ahead. Send a link with a time on it instead."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "グループの部屋は予約できません。代わりに時間を指定したリンクを送ってください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "属于某个组的房间不能预定。改为发送一个带时间的链接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屬於某個群組的房間不能預定。改為傳送一個附有時間的連結。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A scope uses lowercase letters, numbers and dashes, at most 32 of them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A scope uses lowercase letters, numbers and dashes, at most 32 of them."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "グループ名に使えるのは英小文字・数字・ハイフンで、32 文字までです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "组名只能用小写字母、数字和连字符，最多 32 个字符。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "群組名稱只能用小寫字母、數字和連字號，最多 32 個字元。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A signature is what a passphrase produces, and it is public: it prints beside its owner's name in every room they join. Ask somebody for theirs rather than for their passphrase, which this server is never told and could not store." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A signature is what a passphrase produces, and it is public: it prints beside its owner's name in every room they join. Ask somebody for theirs rather than for their passphrase, which this server is never told and could not store."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "署名はパスフレーズから作られるもので、公開情報です。参加したどの部屋でも名前の横に表示されます。パスフレーズではなく署名を訊いてください。パスフレーズはこのサーバーが知ることも保存することもありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "签名是口令生成的,而且是公开的——他们进任何房间时都会显示在名字旁边。向对方要签名,不要口令;口令本服务器从来不会知道,也无法保存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "簽名是通行語生成的,而且是公開的——他們進任何房間時都會顯示在名字旁邊。向對方要簽名,不要通行語;通行語本伺服器從來不會知道,也無法保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
