    "Everybody who types the same word can hear each other, and the server carrying the call cannot. Tell people the word some other way." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everybody who types the same word can hear each other, and the server carrying the call cannot. Tell people the word some other way."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同じ合い言葉を入れた人どうしだけが聞こえ、通話を運ぶサーバーには聞こえません。合い言葉は別の方法で伝えてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入同一个暗号的人才能互相听见,承载通话的服务器听不见。暗号请用别的方式告诉对方。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "輸入同一個暗號的人才能互相聽見,承載通話的伺服器聽不見。暗號請用別的方式告訴對方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everybody will be disconnected and told the room has closed. Links made in the call stop working; links made on an account page do not." : {
