    "Set in the configuration file to let anybody start a meeting here — \"signed\" included, since a passphrase is whatever somebody types. Change it there." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set in the configuration file to let anybody start a meeting here — \"signed\" included, since a passphrase is whatever somebody types. Change it there."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定ファイルで誰でも会議を開ける状態です(signed も含む。合言葉は入力するだけのものなので)。変更は設定ファイルで。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置文件里设成了「任何人都能开会」——包括 signed,因为口令就是随便输的东西。要改请改配置文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定檔裡設成了「任何人都能開會」——包括 signed,因為口令就是隨便輸的東西。要改請改設定檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set in the configuration file to let in anybody who has a room's name — and a room here is a name, so anybody who guesses one. Change it there." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set in the configuration file to let in anybody who has a room's name — and a room here is a name, so anybody who guesses one. Change it there."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定ファイルで「ルーム名を知っている人は誰でも」になっています。ここではルーム名がすべてなので、当てた人も入れます。変更は設定ファイルで。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配置文件里设成了「知道房间名就能进」——而这里房间就是一个名字,所以猜到的人也能进。要改请改配置文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "設定檔裡設成了「知道房間名就能進」——而這裡房間就是一個名字,所以猜到的人也能進。要改請改設定檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
