    "You can do this because you administer this server. Removing somebody ends their call; it does not stop them rejoining." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can do this because you administer this server. Removing somebody ends their call; it does not stop them rejoining."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これができるのはあなたがこのサーバーの管理者だからです。退出させても通話が終わるだけで、入り直しは防げません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你能这么做是因为你是本站管理员。移出只会结束他这次通话,并不能阻止他再进来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你能這麼做是因為你是本站管理員。移出只會結束他這次通話,並不能阻止他再進來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
